msgid ""
"The MAUCH PM's are not available in the Sensor selection list (at time of "
"writing) so you will need to select **Other** and perform a manual "
"calibration. Because the PM uses hall sensors you can ignore the "
"recommendation to calibrate the sensor at >3Amps."
