msgid ""
"`MAUCH <https://www.mauch-electronic.com/#webs-"
"bin-563c137b7add4cb229080f55>`__ has a number of PMs, which are compatible "
"with Pixhawk, APM, Pixhawk lite, AUAV-X2, and CUAV Pixhack. The sensors "
"boards are capable of delivering 100A continuous current for HS-100-V2 and "
"200A for the HS-200-V2 (without any time limit). The maximum burst current "
"is 1200A@25'C and 800A@85'C for 1 second."
msgstr ""
"`MAUCH <https://www.mauch-electronic.com/#webs-"
"bin-563c137b7add4cb229080f55>`__ 提供多款电源模块（PM），与 Pixhawk、APM、Pixhawk "
"lite、AUAV-X2 和 CUAV Pixhack 兼容。其传感器板的持续电流能力为：HS-100-V2 可达 100A，HS-200-V2 可达 "
"200A（无任何时间限制）。最大突发电流为 1200A@25'C 和 800A@85'C，持续 1 秒。"
